  "author": "silvan",
  "description": "Rocket League has no wheel support, so this profile turns on OpenGHub's gamepad mode: the G923 shows up as an Xbox 360 controller with steering on the left stick, accelerator and brake on the triggers, cross/circle/square/triangle as A/B/X/Y (jump, boost, powerslide, ball cam on the default bindings), paddles as the bumpers and Share/Options as Back/Start. The range is 360° with a firm 60% centering spring so the wheel behaves like a self-centering stick.",
